        "name": "Virtua Fighter Kids",
        "summary": "The Virtua Fighter family enters the next generation with a bang! Meet VF Kids! They're small, fast, and hold the secret to all 2,000 Virtua Fighter moves! With hilarious animations and sound effects, and running 20% faster than VF2, this is a must for all fight fans!",
