      {
        "id": 11729,
        "name": "Elevator Action Returns",
        "summary": "Elevator Action Returns, also known as Elevator Action II, is a 1994 run and gun arcade game developed and published by Taito. It is the sequel to Elevator Action (1983), featuring a much more gritty and realistic setting. Returns retains the elevator-based gimmick from the original, but expands the gameplay system and replaces the spy motif with a new scenario involving a paramilitary team fighting against a terrorist group.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co7kii.jpg",
