        "summary": "Blue Seed: The Legend of Hiroku Kushinada is a card fighting adventure game (RPG-ish) based on the anime of Blue Seed. They got all the cast back together to record new lines.\nThe fights are all card based and the cards are just pictures of things like swords and shields. You can even try out the battle system from the main menu to get used to it before diving into the game.",
