        "name": "Atelier Marie Plus: The Alchemist of Salburg",
        "summary": "Atelier Marie Plus was released on June 4, 1998, and is the last version (Version 1.3) of the original game, with upgrades and additional content added.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co4hmw.jpg",
